# ── Polity export master + large geojson dumps (local only — GitHub Free's ──
# 100MB per-file limit, and the 500MB LFS storage cap, are both too small for
# these once the dataset covers more than a couple of polities; Persian Empire
# alone is 104MB. The .geojsonl master was designed as an internal working
# file anyway (see mapper/exports/cliopatria_master.README.md) — actual
# deliverables get filtered down with export_master.py and sent directly,
# not pushed here. The small .csv side of every export (truncated-WKT
# geometry) stays committed regardless of dataset size.
mapper/exports/cliopatria_master.geojsonl
mapper/exports/full_dataset_*.geojson
mapper/exports/persian_empire_*.geojson
